From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:56:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 025/144] GreatDANE: Dane settings pane (per-chain node on/off,
 node status, chain host pattern, update channel, first-run update window);
 hide Mozilla data collection/VPN/Relay/More from Mozilla/Pocket in Settings;
 greatdane.prefs.hideSync (default off); Marionette prefs tests

